      "workflowId": "openai-audio-translations-endpoint-shutdown",
      "summary": "Shows the change: OpenAI deprecated the audio translations endpoint on 2026-08-26 and shuts it down on 2027-02-26, together with whisper-1 and the gpt-4o transcribe models. After that date every call to POST /v1/audio/translations fails.",
